Device 0: Ascend950DT_9582 (arch 3510) | vector cores=64 | UB=216 KiB/core | 1650 MHz

Vector peak: fp4, 12 independent chains, 4096 iterations, 128 lanes/register
Arithmetic: the vector ISA has no FP4 arithmetic instruction, only FP4 conversion and movement, so each update converts FP4->BF16, issues a native BF16 FMA and converts back, keeping FP4 state; the conversions are overhead and are not counted, so this is a pipeline rate with FP4 operands, not a native FP4 vector peak
